That should be enough, assuming you indeed locked the doors.  (I'm not
sure if mind flayers will use keys if they have them, but I'm assuming
yours doesn't.)  Note that, if you're on the same level, you'll get a
message that you're worried about your pet if he's getting too hungry.
(Mind you, if that happens, don't get too close to him before he's
eaten something or he might accidentally suck you.)

