Give him time.  If you're locking him in a room anyway, toss the stuff
you want him to wear into the same room.  With luck, he'll have picked
it up and put it on by the time you get back.

If you had a bullwhip, you could apply it to yank his current weapon
out of his hands and then let him pick up the mattock.  And if you
were polymorphed into a nymph, you could use #monster to steal things
off him.  And if pigs had wings...

